      "content": "SP 90 NW      CHOLESBURY-CUM-ST. LEONARDS      HAWRIDGE                                                (south side) 2/67                                           Full Moon                                                Public House - -                                              II Public House. C18, with earlier core.  Colourwashed brick, old tile roof, wide chimney stack in centre.  Two storeys.  Door left of centre, one 3-light casement on left, two on right, two 3-light and one 2-light casement to first floor.  Insurance plate in centre.  Interior:  large inglenook fireplace in centre. Listing NGR: SP9354306960"
    }
